  "notes": "A dark IDE-style editor around a 1995-style pixel-art isometric map, which takes up most of the screen. The selected entity is shown with a translucent yellow diamond tile grid. Selected states use a blue 1px outline on a #2d3852 fill: tab pills, cards, and checkbox chips. Entity list rows use emoji type icons (📦 📍 ◇ ⬚), while toolbar icons are line style, so icons are mixed. A bottom status bar with an amber ⚠ count of pending items and monospace asset warnings is not covered by any codebook entry (proposed as status-bar). The UI is in Chinese; IDs are in monospace. Every reorderable list offers keyboard lift-and-move plus up/down buttons."
}
